        "jsCode": "const currentCount = $('Upsert Rate Limit').first().json.request_count;\nconst previousCount = $('Get Previous Window Count').first().json.previous_count;\n\nconst windowMs = 10 * 60 * 1000;\nconst windowStartMs = new Date($('Compute Rate Limit Key').item.json.windowStart).getTime();\nconst elapsedMs = Date.now() - windowStartMs;\nconst overlapFraction = Math.max(0, (windowMs - elapsedMs) / windowMs);\n\nconst estimatedCount = currentCount + (previousCount * overlapFraction);\n\nreturn [{ json: { estimatedCount } }];"
